  "full-article-text": "<p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Step 1: </strong>Please go to <a id=\"\" href=\"http://instapass.io\">Instapass</a>.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:448px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"448px\"><div id=\"\"><img id=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60540b6d30224a7cb015203a/69eb247f8dc43830fd1dd802_60f7241a4753958fa86917cf_vSQIBSpSEu2HS3ZSxZudIHabmK2ZEzWOGog2WDyGUpIl-C2dLvyrVBdRT-_dD4kG6_wlL2QiVlvaUzsxOtHXHQGLX_-Ldhfz6mMtZ18u9nMgG_C2F-QqQ3IKfp8vTBn4CExvC-rA.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Step 2:</strong> Click “Forgot password”, then confirm your email address.&nbsp;</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:446px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"446px\"><div id=\"\"><img id=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60540b6d30224a7cb015203a/69eb247f8dc43830fd1dd7ff_60f7241a88a5ed1bd9a4c244_gmc9B1cN-bilq9-2SDm8xrjdgzx24GC2tlLhBL-W6ccWJ15kk_uDHKe1_7jEFHsp3Zi8M6Ygn8utT2J-LQFqAPL_QaNzzAeQWPKjKMszmEhwPl7cPQJNM9LvQwF13JvGeySOr9VH.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Step 3:</strong> You should receive an email from no-reply@instapass.io with a link to reset your password. Click “Choose new password”.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:593px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"593px\"><div id=\"\"><img id=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60540b6d30224a7cb015203a/69eb247f8dc43830fd1dd805_60f7241a683de0847dee8a92_Ca95AmhYxz-LPauGM9zNXsxi9SPQmbhv7CIifM7JeSf1tTuYaLKSDUS4JjR8oHYSttfVzYeXVkrKVH1Zq_5OkzbGmmWSEUU6_p7wVEmk3Krjb9kALJ-jMKx6PYZhI1IDnWEQm5zQ.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">Enter and confirm your new password, then click “Reset password”.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:447px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"447px\"><div id=\"\"><img id=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60540b6d30224a7cb015203a/69eb247f8dc43830fd1dd7fc_60f7241a1c3d6ef9a3c01f43_ezV_KRyxDPcAZzNv1ltcDoGcP34r34-SKv78q5GqC-i9bOiHu0MuYjdor2JhbbMvWf84y102ylZi-d2oTYM8VQzdfiGt48mw5De11Wc6lop8OF3oBJs1Ha6hTssmI1y3nHx6Vo06.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">You should then be able to login to Instapass with your new password.<br></p>",
